{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:89083","published":"2026-10-24T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-10-29T11:02:25.451017111Z","related":["CVE-2026-53236","CVE-2026-53388","CVE-2026-64378","CVE-2026-68136","CVE-2026-68138","CVE-2026-68140","CVE-2026-68338","CVE-2026-68476","CVE-2026-80586","CVE-2026-80824","CVE-2026-81003","CVE-2026-89638","CVE-2026-99999"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-53236","CVE-2026-53388","CVE-2026-64378","CVE-2026-68136","CVE-2026-68138","CVE-2026-68140","CVE-2026-68338","CVE-2026-68476","CVE-2026-80586","CVE-2026-80824","CVE-2026-81003","CVE-2026-89638","CVE-2026-99999"],"summary":"Important: kernel security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The kernel packages contain the Linux kernel, the core of any Linux operating system.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * kernel: tcp: restrict SO_ATTACH_FILTER to priv users (CVE-2026-53236)\n  * kernel: fuse: re-lock request before replacing page cache folio (CVE-2026-53388)\n  * kernel: writeback: fix race between cgroup_writeback_umount() and inode_switch_wbs() (CVE-2026-64378)\n  * kernel: net: gro: fix double aggregation of flush-marked skbs (CVE-2026-68136)\n  * kernel: net/packet: avoid fanout hook re-registration after unregister (CVE-2026-68338)\n  * kernel: net/iucv: fix use-after-free of a severed iucv_path (CVE-2026-68140)\n  * kernel: net/sched: serialize qdisc_rtab_list against concurrent get/put (CVE-2026-68138)\n  * kernel: ipvs: reload ip header after head reallocation (CVE-2026-68476)\n  * kernel: mptcp: options: reset DSS fields in case of unexpected size (CVE-2026-80586)\n  * kernel: usb: usbfs: fix use-after-free of usb_device in usbdev_release() (CVE-2026-80824)\n  * kernel: smb: client: clear setuid/setgid bit on write with cifsacl/modefromsid/posix extensions (CVE-2026-89638)\n  * kernel: net/iucv: filter frames in afiucv_hs_rcv() by ingress device (CVE-2026-81003)\n  * kernel: ipv4: validate checksum_start before completing checksum\n\n\n(CVE-2026-99999)  \n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Backport 6785011f8b16 (\"ipv4: validate checksum_start before completing checksum\") [almalinux-8.10.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-280584)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bpftool","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bpftool"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.178.1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:89083.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.178.1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:89083.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-abi-stablelists","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-abi-stablelists"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.178.1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:89083.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-core","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-core"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.178.1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:89083.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-cross-headers","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel-cross-headers"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.178.1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA